  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "風險管理與保險專題研討",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS IN RISK MANAGEMENT & INSURANCE",
    "describe_ch": "在今日的社會裡，企業必須對許多的風險作出回應，而這其中包括了人身風險和非人身風險。在這個課程中，我們將檢視產業內的各種經濟、金融、與法律等風險。另一方面，本專題研究將致力於提升學生在分析各產業內保險議題的技巧和知識。最後，學生們必須完成一篇符合本科生水平的高質量研究論文。",
    "describe_eh": "Corporations in today's society have to respond to numerous risks, including life and non-life risk exposures. In this course, several kinds of risk exposures (e.g., economic, financial, and legal risk exposures) in the industry will be examined. On the other hand, this seminar will dedicate to the improvement of students’ skills and knowledge for the analysis of insurance issues across industries. In the end, the students have to complete an undergraduate’s level thesis that should be written in a high quality research standard.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "學生具備商管基礎專業知識。",
      "describe_en": " Students possess basic knowledge and understanding in relation to business and management"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "學生具備溝通技巧。",
      "describe_en": "Students are able to be effective communicators."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "學生具備專業倫理觀念與態度。",
      "describe_en": "Students are able to demonstrate awareness of ethical concepts and attitudes in the business environment."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "學生具備分析與解決問題之能力。",
      "describe_en": "Students possess problem solving skills, supported by appropriate analytical techniques."
    }
  ],
